@startuml SD7_WebCal_Sync_Export
!theme plain
autonumber
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10
skinparam ResponseMessageBelowArrow true

title UC-CAL-02: Đăng ký & Đồng bộ Luồng Lịch WebCal 1 Chiều RFC 5545 (Use-Case Realization)

actor "External Calendar App\n(Google / Apple Calendar)" as ExtCal
box "Presentation Layer" #E9ECEF
    participant "LogSanitizerMiddleware\n(Security Filter)" as LogMid
    participant "CalendarRouter\n(FastAPI)" as Router
end box
box "Application Layer" #DEE2E6
    participant "ExportCalendarFeedUC\n(Use Case)" as CalUC
end box
box "Infrastructure & Security" #CED4DA
    participant "SqlWebCalRepo\n(WebCalRepoPort)" as WebCalRepo
    participant "SqlTaskRepo\n(TaskRepoPort)" as TaskRepo
    participant "IcalGeneratorAdapter\n(CalendarExportPort)" as IcalGen
    participant "PostgreSQL 16\n(Database)" as DB
end box

ExtCal -> LogMid: GET /api/v1/calendar/feed/{raw_token}.ics (HTTP Polling định kỳ)
activate LogMid

note over LogMid: Log Sanitizer Middleware (NFR-SEC-004):\nGhi Access Log: "GET /api/v1/calendar/feed/[REDACTED].ics"\nĐảm bảo bí mật token không bị rò rỉ vào file log!
LogMid -> Router: forward_sanitized_request(raw_token)
activate Router

Router -> CalUC: export_feed_by_token(raw_token)
activate CalUC

note over CalUC: Băm SHA-256 token thô:\ntoken_hash = hash_sha256(raw_token)
CalUC -> WebCalRepo: find_active_subscription_by_hash(token_hash)
activate WebCalRepo
WebCalRepo -> DB: query_active_webcal_token(token_hash)
activate DB
DB --> WebCalRepo: tokenRecord
deactivate DB

alt [Token không hợp lệ hoặc đã bị vô hiệu hóa]
    WebCalRepo --> CalUC: null
    deactivate WebCalRepo
    CalUC --> Router: throw InvalidCalendarTokenException
    deactivate CalUC
    Router --> ExtCal: 401 Unauthorized {"error": "INVALID_CALENDAR_TOKEN"}
    deactivate Router
    deactivate LogMid
else [Token hợp lệ (ACTIVE)]
    WebCalRepo --> CalUC: webCalSubscriptionEntity
    deactivate WebCalRepo

    CalUC -> WebCalRepo: record_feed_access(token_hash)
    activate WebCalRepo
    WebCalRepo -> DB: update_last_accessed_timestamp(token_hash)
    activate DB
    DB --> WebCalRepo: OK
    deactivate DB
    WebCalRepo --> CalUC: OK
    deactivate WebCalRepo

    CalUC -> TaskRepo: get_active_scheduled_tasks(userId)
    activate TaskRepo
    TaskRepo -> DB: query_tasks_for_calendar_feed(userId)
    activate DB
    DB --> TaskRepo: taskRecords
    deactivate DB
    TaskRepo --> CalUC: taskEntities
    deactivate TaskRepo

    CalUC -> IcalGen: generate_ical_stream(taskEntities)
    activate IcalGen
    note over IcalGen: Chuẩn hóa dữ liệu theo chuẩn RFC 5545:\n- Khởi tạo VCALENDAR chuẩn UTF-8\n- Tạo VEVENT với UID, DTSTART, DTEND, SUMMARY, DESCRIPTION\n- Tương thích 100% Google Calendar và Apple Calendar
    IcalGen --> CalUC: icalContentStream (.ics)
    deactivate IcalGen

    CalUC --> Router: CalendarFeedDTO(content=icalContentStream, mime_type="text/calendar")
    deactivate CalUC

    Router --> ExtCal: 200 OK (Content-Type: text/calendar; charset=utf-8)
    deactivate Router
    deactivate LogMid

    note over ExtCal: Ứng dụng Lịch tự động nạp sự kiện và hiển thị trên Lịch cá nhân của người học
end

@enduml